WEBVTT

00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:17,470
H-I-I-T exercise is the best exercise for your heart, bar none.

00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:22,750
So that means you're doing, you're basically doing intervals.

00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:26,990
When I used to be in track, we'd run intervals, and I was in cross-country at track,

00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:32,470
and you run as fast as you can for a period of time, you're running 400 meter intervals,

00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:37,470
or 800 meter intervals, and then you have a period of rest that you go again,

00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:40,510
and you go as hard as you possibly can.

00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:45,550
That has been proven to be absolutely the best exercise for your heart,

00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:51,710
because that's the exercise that you'd use to build blood vessels.

00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:57,710
So that's what stimulates blood vessel production.

00:00:57,710 --> 00:01:03,950
So it stimulates VAD-JF, so that's the vascular endothelial growth factor.

00:01:03,950 --> 00:01:05,390
That's what stimulates that.

00:01:06,350 --> 00:01:12,750
But the thing is, when you have cancer, you don't want to stimulate vascular endothelial growth factor.

00:01:12,750 --> 00:01:20,590
I mean, that's you do not want to stimulate that, so I didn't even touch on that point,

00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:26,510
but you're also, when you're doing that, working to exhaustion,

00:01:26,510 --> 00:01:32,190
putting yourself in a completely anaerobic state, giving the cancer its feel to grow.

00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:41,470
So you don't want to do that when you have a history of cancer.

